'''G1 Climax 2026 Day 16''' was the sixteenth show of the [[G1 Climax 2026]] tournament produced by [[New Okaiken Pro-Wrestling|NOPW]], held on October 5, 2026 at the Tsuda Municipal Gymnasium in [[Tsuda]]. The show featured all five [[G1 Climax 2026|Block B]] Round 8 matches.

The night is remembered for the block's marquee collision answering its question — [[Takagi Yuto]] handing [[Taumafa Vaiahi|Taumafa]] his second loss with the Dragon lariat — and for [[Diego Reyes|Diego "The Cobra" Reyes]], winless in seven rounds, pinning the man who ended the 1,095-day reign.

